~ scene38flashback1
Carmilla waits at the school entrance for Margaret to walk home together, but she does not show up after 2 hours.
Carmilla's Mother: Carmilla! Where have thou been?
Carmilla's Father: Where is dear Peggy?
Carmilla: I hast no idea.. She did not show up after schooling!
Carmilla's Mother: Oh dear.. We must report it to the police!
Carmilla's Father: My dear, we must not. I am afraid it is out of our hands.
Carmilla: But Father! It is Margaret! We must not leave her behind!
Carmilla's Father: I am sorry, young Carmilla. Come. We must go back home.


~ scene38flashback2
???: Excuse me, miss?
Carmilla: Yes? Doth need help?
???: My husband and I wanted to bid thou some questions.
Carmilla: If you must.
???: We are asking around about our daughter. She has been gone for 10 years now. We pray this is the school she went to. 
Carmilla: What is her name?
???: Margaret. Margaret Dubois.
Carmilla is extremely shocked to hear Margaret's name. 
Carmilla: She hath been living with us. For the past 10 years...
Margarets's Mother: Preposterous! Thou took our only daughter?! Police! Police! This woman hath stolen our daughter!
Carmilla: No.. you do not understand! I love her!
The police arrive.
Carmilla: I am sorry! Please do not have thy taken away!
Magaret's Father: Arrest this young lady! She hath robbed us from our daughter!!
=> END

~ scene39carmillaroom1
Carmilla breaks down the door.
Carmilla: You have made a grave mistake Lauren!
Lauren: Wait! I know who the woman in the painting is.
Carmilla: .....Whom?
Lauren: Margaret. My 3rd great grandmother. Her last name was Dubois. And you loved her..
Carmilla: ..How doth you know?
Lauren: I saw her memories. Just like you did when you bit me, correct?
Carmilla: What a smart one you are.
Lauren: My grandmother, Margaret- she knew about you being a vampire didn't she. Why didn't she run away earlier?
Carmilla: Daisy was in love with [shake]me![/shake] She ran away from [shake]mine love![/shake] To another country!! Why doth she do this to me?!
Lauren: Carmilla, I am sorry for what happened in the past. I am not Margaret, even though you may think I am. 
Carmilla: Thou shall never be my Margaret!
Lauren: Then what do you want from me?
Carmilla: For thou to stay here with mine for eternity. The way it should have been with Daisy and I. Our love can flourish and match what Daisy and I had, rekindling our love from the past!
Lauren: You can't keep me here forever! Even though you resent my grandmother for leaving, that doesn't mean you have to take it out on me!
Carmilla: ...I will give thine one more chance to please me. It would be in thy best interest to stay.
